Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hill Giant and have Rancor (enchanted creature gets +2/+0 and trample) and Giant Growth in hand with one green mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls an untapped Kor Firewalker (2/2, protection from red). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-trample-protection-blocker | A trampler must assign lethal damage to its blockers before the player, and lethal is judged by toughness even if protection will prevent it (CR 702.19b-c): Rancor's 5/3 trampler assigns 2 to the Firewalker and 3 to the player; Giant Growth's 6/6 is simply blocked
